'''ERI''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 217
|rarity = RR
|name1 = ERI
|name2 = ERI CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''ERI CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
ERI is much like a faster-attacking [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]] but unfortunately has the same weaknesses as it. As with Wheel, ERI only outranges melee Aliens like Cyberhorn and Nimoy Bore, and only does so reliably with [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway/Seafarer Cat]] or other [[Freeze|Freeze]] units. Other than potentially being useful in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], both can be used to chip at backliners or slip into the blindspots of [[Long Distance]] attackers, though that is it. Wheel gets the extra range and cooldown it strongly needs to counter more enemies upon becoming Chill Cat, something ERI doesn't have and is promptly outclassed by.

{{Job|Classification = Melee}}

