==Trivia==
*ERI is based off of [[wikia:metalslug:Eri Kasamoto|Eri Kasamoto]] from the Metal Slug series.
*ERI's Normal and Evolved Form descriptions originally began with "Recruited from Metal Slug Defense!". They were changed in [[Version 13.1 Update|Ver. 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Ver. 13.7]] for all other versions to reflect the fact that ''Metal Slug Defense'' was no longer the specific game in the series that was being collaborated with.
*Although ERI's descriptions claim she ''might'' cause massive damage, massive damage is not a chance-based ability and will always occur.

